#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our <strong>Antwerp Discovery Bus Tour</strong> invites you to explore the "
"many layers of this fascinating city, from its medieval heart to its modern "
"edge. Glide past the towering Cathedral of Our Lady and the vibrant Grote "
"Markt, admire the intricate guild houses, and learn how a 16th-century port "
"grew into one of the world’s diamond capitals."
msgstr ""
"Naš <strong>Antwerp Discovery Bus Tour</strong> vas vabi, da raziščete "
"številne plasti tega fascinantnega mesta, od njegovega srednjeveškega jedra "
"do njegove sodobne obrobnosti. Zapeljite mimo mogočne katedrale Device "
"Marije in živahnega trga Grote Markt, občudujte razkošno oblikovane cehovske "
"hiše ter odkrijte, kako se je pristanišče iz 16. stoletja preraslo v eno "
"izmed svetovnih diamantnih prestolnic."

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our <strong>Brussels Explorer Tour</strong> takes you on a rich and varied "
"ride through the city's many faces — from the grandeur of the Royal Palace "
"to the modern glass towers of the European Quarter, from medieval alleyways "
"near the Grand-Place to the sprawling beauty of Cinquantenaire Park."
msgstr ""
"Naša <strong>Raziskovalna tura po Bruslju</strong> vas popelje na bogato in "
"raznoliko potovanje skozi številne obraze mesta — od veličastnosti Kraljeve "
"palače do sodobnih steklenih stolpov Evropske četrti, od srednjeveških "
"uličic v bližini trga Grand-Place do razkošne lepote parka Cinquantenaire."

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our <strong>Ghent Highlights Bus Tour</strong> gives you a front-row seat to "
"this city’s rich past and dynamic present. From the imposing Castle of the "
"Counts to the shimmering St. Bavo’s Cathedral, from the industrial docklands "
"reborn into cultural hubs to student-filled squares echoing with laughter "
"and debate — Ghent is full of contrast, and endlessly fascinating."
msgstr ""
"Naš <strong>Ghent Highlights Bus Tour</strong> vam ponuja pogled iz prve "
"vrste v bogato preteklost in dinamično sedanjost tega mesta. Od mogočnega "
"grofovega gradu do sijoče katedrale sv. Bava, od industrijskih pristaniških "
"območij, ki so se preobrazila v kulturna središča, do trgov, polnih "
"študentov, ki odmevajo od smeha in debat — Gent je poln kontrastov in "
"neizčrpno fascinanten."

#. module: guided_tours
#: model_terms:event.event,description:guided_tours.event_event_3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our <strong>Namur Discovery Tour</strong> invites you to sit back, relax, "
"and enjoy a panoramic journey through the city’s most iconic sites and "
"neighborhoods. Whether you're just visiting for the day or want to deepen "
"your understanding of this fascinating city, our professional guide will "
"bring Namur to life with engaging commentary, local anecdotes, and "
"surprising facts."
msgstr ""
"Naš <strong>ogled Namurja z odkrivanjem</strong> vas vabi, da se udobno "
"namestite, sprostite in uživate v panoramskem potovanju skozi najbolj "
"ikonične znamenitosti in četrti mesta. Ne glede na to, ali mesto obiskujete "
"le za en dan ali pa želite poglobiti svoje razumevanje tega fascinantnega "
"mesta, vam bo naš profesionalni vodnik Namur približal z zanimivimi "
"komentarji, lokalnimi anekdotami in presenetljivimi dejstvi."

